<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Mert'in Sitesi</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: #0f0f0f;
            color: white;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .container {
            padding: 30px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 45px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        p {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #111;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .button:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Merhaba 👋</h1>

        <p>
            Ben Mert. Bu siteyi Termux ile yaptım.
        </p>

        <a href="#" class="button">
            Başla 🚀
        </a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
